# Model weights are never committed, wherever they land. These patterns are deliberately
# repository-wide rather than scoped to models/: the training toolchain downloads its own
# assets into the working directory, so weights appear outside any anticipated location.
# No weight file has ever been tracked, so these rules untrack nothing.
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.engine

